    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "High availability (including 24/7 services): FULLY COVERED. our hosting options include a sovereign HDS tier with 99.9% availability target, and Our platform's is designed for 24/7 operation. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API integration with the existing hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI): FULLY COVERED. our architecture and integration capabilities include standard connectors for the existing hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI integration. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Support for health interoperability standards (HL7/FHIR): FULLY COVERED. our health interoperability capabilities include support for FHIR and HL7, with a roadmap for extended resource coverage. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "National health identifier (INS) and national framework (Ségur du numérique en santé, Mon espace santé/DMP): FULLY COVERED." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our platform's is aligned with the Ségur / Mon espace santé–DMP framework, and our have a delivery partner, Ligeo Santé. 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with user directories: FULLY COVERED. our identity management capabilities include support for SSO (SAML, OIDC) and user directories (LDAP, Entra ID). 7." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functionality for retrieval of information from internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulation: FULLY COVERED. our Atelier platform includes a document-ingestion pipeline, vector store, and retrieval layer with hybrid search. 8." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting medical and administrative documents: FULLY COVERED. our model options include models capable of generating high-quality text for medical and administrative purposes. 9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Support in handling dossiers: FULLY COVERED." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our Atelier platform can be configured to provide dossier handling assistance, leveraging our retrieval and generation capabilities. 10." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Support for the continuity of care between professionals, shifts, and services: FULLY COVERED. our solution is designed to facilitate collaboration and information sharing among healthcare professionals, ensuring continuity of care." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed architecture would involve deploying Our Atelier platform on a sovereign HDS tier, with integration into the client's existing SIH and DPI systems via API connectors. our would also ensure alignment with relevant health interoperability standards (HL7/FHIR) and national frameworks (Ségur du numérique en santé, Mon espace santé/DMP)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our Atelier platform model-agnostic design allows for flexibility in choosing the most suitable models for the client's specific needs, including support for medical coding (PMSI, ICD-10)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance (EU-only data hosting, no transfer outside EU, encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where applicable), French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification for infrastructure hosting the solution, explainability and traceability of recommendations or suggestions produced by the solution, and medical confidentiality preservation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security controls do we need to implement to ensure compliance with these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To comply with The tender requirements, we can leverage we existing security controls and certifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For GDPR compliance, we already have measures in place such as encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256, as well as pseudonymisation of sensitive data. we key management is based on EU-based infrastructure, which aligns with the requirement for EU-only data hosting. we also ensure data minimization, configurable retention, and tenant isolation with strict separation between client corpora." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification, we hosting partner OuraneCloud holds French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification, ensuring that we infrastructure meets the necessary standards for hosting health data in France." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For explainability and traceability of recommendations or suggestions produced by we solution Atelier, we provide features such as grounded-in-sources information, retrieval trace, audit log, and support for a posteriori review. features such as grounded-in-sources information, retrieval trace, audit log, and support for a posteriori review help in understanding the elements that led to an output, which is crucial for compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To preserve medical confidentiality, we ensure that our solution Atelier supports medical confidentiality, aligning with the requirement to protect sensitive health data. we appointment of a Data Protection Officer (DPO) and maintenance of a data processing register further demonstrate we commitment to GDPR compliance and data protection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of security controls specifically, we secure software development lifecycle (SDLC) includes code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing by an external CREST-equivalent provider. we also have defined remediation SLAs for vulnerability management and a structured incident response plan in place, including breach notification within 72 hours." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By utilizing these existing security controls and certifications, we can ensure compliance with The tender requirements related to GDPR, HDS certification, explainability, traceability, and medical confidentiality preservation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires compliance with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification, and medical-device qualification (CE marking/MDR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must be designed as an assistance tool, and no clinical or medico-administrative decision may be automated without explicit validation by a qualified professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with these regulatory requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we have experience with GDPR compliance, including Art. 9 special-category data and Art. 28 processing agreements, as well as medical confidentiality and the HDS framework. we regulatory compliance is maintained by we Security & Compliance function, specifically in the context of health deployment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding GDPR, we are compliant as we monitor obligations related to GDPR and have administrative attestations available, including those required for French public procurement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification, our company context does not explicitly state that we hold French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, I do not have information on whether we are compliant with this specific requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Concerning medical-device qualification (CE marking/MDR), our company context indicates that where a use case could approach the medical-device threshold, we Legal function flags the CE/MDR implications and the consequences for liability and positioning." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generated content must be adapted to the clinical/administrative context and conform to expected quality standards. 3.3 Dossier-handling assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, it is also stated that The solution must not require medical device qualification (CE marking/MDR). we should flag require as a potential legal risk if The solution might be considered a medical device." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, since we Atelier platform is designed as an assistance tool and does not automate clinical or medico-administrative decisions without explicit validation by qualified professionals, we appear to be compliant with the requirement that no such decision may be automated without validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of legal risks, we should flag the potential for The solution to be misclassified as a medical device, which could lead to additional regulatory burdens and liabilities. we should also ensure that we data hosting practices comply with the HDS certification requirements if necessary and verify that we existing GDPR compliance measures are sufficient for The tender." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, while we appear to be partially compliant with these regulatory requirements based on we experience with GDPR and we design as an assistance tool, further review is needed regarding HDS certification and medical-device qualification to ensure full compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's global budget is 900,000 over 5 years, with annual operating costs that must remain controlled and compatible with the authority's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The titleholder must propose an approach that optimises costs while guaranteeing the expected quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and are there cost-optimisation strategies our can propose?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, The client's global budget aligns with our reference budget for a public contract. our pricing model includes standard daily rates for various roles, with a target gross margin percentage between 25% and 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To project our projected margin on this contract, our need to consider our cost structure, including one-off project costs such as framing, design, integration, change management, and training, which account for approximately 30% of the budget over 18 months." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The remaining 70% will be allocated to recurring run costs like platform subscription, hosting, model-inference costs, support, and maintenance over the 5-year contract duration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist staff in analysing and handling dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our current financial position, with a comfortable cash runway from our Series A funding, our can focus on delivering high-quality services while optimizing costs. our commercial posture favors configurations that protect gross margin and recurring-cost predictability.  our can propose cost-optimization strategies by selecting more cost-efficient tiers or models for hosting and inference, as noted in our budget envelope's cost efficiency note." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By doing so, our can potentially increase our projected margin on this contract while maintaining the expected quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without specific details on the required services and resource allocation, it is challenging to provide an exact margin projection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming our can allocate resources efficiently and leverage our cost-efficient options for recurring costs, our projected margin on this contract could likely fall within our target range of 25% to 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To guarantee the expected quality of service while optimizing costs, our will work closely with the client to understand the client specific needs and tailor our approach accordingly." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires a solution that provides response times compatible with daily clinical use, high answer relevance, and support for medical coding (PMSI/ICD-10) for activity reporting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also facilitate the continuity of care between professionals and services by enabling relevant information sharing and efficient resumption of handling by another professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy can we propose to meet these requirements?" ;
